---
title: ":custard: Sand Cups"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 8
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 0 minutes
total time: 1 hour 15 minutes
tags:
  - desserts
  - pudding
  - kids
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

Pour @cold milk{2%cups} into a #large bowl{}. Add @vanilla instant pudding mix{4-serving size%pkg}. Beat with a #whisk{} until well blended, 1 to ~{2%minutes}. Let stand for ~{5%minutes} to thicken.

Stir in @whipped topping{8%oz%tub} and half of the crushed @vanilla wafers{12%oz%pkg}.

Place 1 Tbsp of crushed wafers into the bottom of individual #cups{8}.

Fill cups about 3/4 full with the pudding mixture. Top with remaining crushed wafers.

Refrigerate for at least ~{1%hour} before serving.
